%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/io_test.clj:228 (writeXml-escapeCR-test)
testing: escapeCR true — CR characters escaped to &#xD;
元の形: io/writeXml の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
write({"root": {"text": "line1\r\nline2"}}, "application/xml", {"escapeCR": true})
%%% output application/json
"<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>\n<root>\n  <text>line1&#xd;\nline2</text>\n</root>"
